    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Berty the Giraffe is an arcade-style turn-based 2D roguelike, Players take control of Berty, a giraffe on a quest to navigate procedurally generated levels filled with dangerous enemies and obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Levels:</strong> No two runs are the same, with dynamically generated environments ensuring endless replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Scores: </strong>Compete with your friends to get the highest score or the deepest level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessibility:</strong>\u00a0Large fonts and simple game mechanics ensure an enjoyable experience for all players.<br>\u00a0</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Berty the Giraffe is an arcade-style turn-based 2D roguelike, Players take control of Berty, a giraffe on a quest to navigate procedurally generated levels filled with dangerous enemies and obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Levels:</strong> No two runs are the same, with dynamically generated environments ensuring endless replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Scores: </strong>Compete with your friends to get the highest score or the deepest level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessibility:</strong>\u00a0Large fonts and simple game mechanics ensure an enjoyable experience for all players.<br>\u00a0</p></li></ul>",
